                  <nc xml:id="m-e7c6aec9-725c-4a81-9d9b-8d35096bdcb5" pname="g" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-3ae3b67d-21a0-4a1e-a2ae-3d824277a56e" pname="f" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-a9093441-8eba-4316-b9e9-482588f6586e" facs="#m-873b35f8-7bff-4f43-b041-313907e7793c" form="maxima" /><divLine xml:id="m-25a32145-7de5-46bd-aed2-e390a3f61acb" facs="#m-619d1674-3907-4e04-bcf2-4a413066186a" form="maior" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-415b8373-8ae8-4581-a7fd-81cf74fac23a">
            <lg xml:id="m-a8ea7e91-7f6a-47f3-98b3-86b0a4a82385">
              <l xml:id="m-ec986f30-8876-4f08-8412-7e51599a4eae" facs="#m-75397207-87a0-4207-a7f2-9be43bea51ac" label="ambiguous">January 16. 17. 18.</l><l xml:id="m-6c6bb1c1-bf14-42e3-b0d4-e9502e7a8013" facs="#m-22fc6cad-8659-4a87-8693-6e41a67a1d19" label="ambiguous">1330</l><l xml:id="m-68d20124-80a3-47d9-9cfa-2ab8d6bc5c28" facs="#m-4755546e-1d8d-47d2-8016-5292eab7f4b6" label="text-like">St. Marcellus I, Pope and Martyr. Siduble.</l><l xml:id="m-e8b780b6-05a3-402b-ba1f-0fd991199f30" facs="#m-684658ea-6d9a-478c-9066-f6eb05b9377c" label="ambiguous">16.</l><l xml:id="m-1524dd94-3623-4818-a818-2a66c1e920e3" facs="#m-f229514c-a2f3-42b0-a8f5-f4f002ee8915" label="text-like">Mass. Si diligis me. 1122*.</l><l xml:id="m-5e62a53e-9ca3-400b-85bf-b73f695dafb6" facs="#m-b47c4ab2-9c74-45df-8b51-a281da6e6bf3" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-ddb61c11-0616-4ff1-945a-f494ec0ccb17" facs="#m-ccd98902-036e-4e5b-b4e7-78d66629715e" label="lyrics-like">DReces pópuli tui, quaésumus! Pontificis, méritis adjuvémur,</l><l xml:id="m-9e1cb1ae-af8b-4d7d-a147-4da16a53fce0" facs="#m-6ba01ce3-9272-4d72-a1c4-f5330de3c125" label="lyrics-like">cujus passióne lactámur. Per Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-257774eb-b493-4281-85ff-f190d5d77f0a" facs="#m-2fed5e36-7d3e-433d-b2d8-bfea6ffd1377" label="lyrics-like">EDómine, cleménter exáudi:</l><l xml:id="m-ef67689f-3d70-435b-846f-3f8eed610dfb" facs="#m-94fcc97e-3673-4489-bc0f-9bc4f3db91d8" label="lyrics-like">ut beáti Marcélli. Mártyris tui atque! minum.</l><l xml:id="m-15eab9fa-f384-4d71-8041-f77142edecec" facs="#m-2d0cec15-40ac-4987-97cb-2d58c3b3c216" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-fe1f7528-c410-4b5f-a40e-b531cf139bd5" facs="#m-1b1cd771-b982-4e26-9111-6b166a2efc4e" label="lyrics-like">Blátis munéribus, quaésumus! proficiat ubíque succéssus, et grati</l><l xml:id="m-bf9d5de2-94aa-41ca-aec7-04bcd56aa581" facs="#m-e4597b47-dafa-4b4e-873e-a6a739cd5404" label="lyrics-like">U Dómine, Ecclésiam tuam benf-[ fiant nómini tuo, te gubernánte,</l><l xml:id="m-0693a6c0-de2b-42de-ba71-ba2cb239e8c7" facs="#m-1646a568-24e9-442f-9f38-f694027e22ef" label="lyrics-like">gnus illúmina: ut, et gregis tui l pastóres. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-0a11e497-60a9-4621-a57d-df7f77f6e4b9" facs="#m-48d9d788-4c6e-4657-ae58-edc19f76bc80" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-d9eecad1-d0d5-46b5-bac1-3057cf2d8360" facs="#m-73f286c7-2516-4122-bfdb-48226f92d42e" label="lyrics-like">»Efectióne sancta enutrítam gu-]creménta libertátis accipiat et in</l><l xml:id="m-d9e31e5e-1a0d-4719-9f05-e9a4dc59943b" facs="#m-dac6160b-61b9-4e35-98cb-43a01d54dd31" label="lyrics-like">religiónis integritáte persístat. Per</l><l xml:id="m-44e227d9-9f02-429d-99c7-53f0bc6f6fcf" facs="#m-ef699648-4562-4deb-a00e-d5aa02d2ac52" label="lyrics-like">It bérna, quaésumus Dómine,</l><l xml:id="m-ad589abd-1e1b-4533-9c56-8c74090b31e1" facs="#m-8d41b601-8108-4bc4-9fce-69e4aad84dab" label="lyrics-like">tuam placátus Ecclésiam: ut po¬</l><l xml:id="m-798f106b-d2d6-4db4-a482-5d2c4c28824d" facs="#m-e6e3b6ea-a291-4e5c-9d18-57bf6cf8ec37" label="lyrics-like">Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-1f2f3905-a706-40cb-b97e-68923363872d" facs="#m-d3ce8508-e0d1-4e68-957b-d8181799f389" label="lyrics-like">ténti moderatióne dirécta, et in¬</l><l xml:id="m-9547f219-3d5f-4ea8-b716-ccc24e493312" facs="#m-12f3259b-973e-48fd-90d3-98d9a51df93f" label="ambiguous">St. Anthony. Abbot.</l><l xml:id="m-c7ae72d5-6c8f-481a-89ee-e40e6f83cb06" facs="#m-1fdcc828-3263-47c6-a7df-962d56d4b677" label="ambiguous">17.</l><l xml:id="m-44d91668-7121-4cd6-bf0d-c3c9b8a2fc54" facs="#m-56aa04db-b196-4329-8c48-b3daf335f4b3" label="ambiguous">Double.</l><l xml:id="m-8e503648-dc27-42fb-9936-9d7d2ad35b5f" facs="#m-865c81c4-190b-4f10-89d2-0ac36db7b5be" label="lyrics-like">Mass. Os jústi. from the Common of Abbots, p. 1206, except the Gospel</l><l xml:id="m-e4b5b223-b2a5-41d8-8c45-b6e0c03a2469" facs="#m-4bffe9c5-6f29-4246-9f2f-88f1814108b1" label="ambiguous">Sint lumbi vestri. p. 1202.</l><l xml:id="m-c7efb1c9-c4fa-47dd-826c-a3b8461a2c33" facs="#m-1243fd63-704a-4e4c-9980-b3985233c0bd" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-125eb25c-8114-44d1-9174-6f63507a6c63" facs="#m-7d180a27-f03d-4b06-8fe2-f3f21d41c340" label="lyrics-like">TNtercéssio nos, quaésumus Dó-]méritis non valémus, “eius patro¬</l><l xml:id="m-fd8a7ac5-2713-47a0-856f-63eda188b2b6" facs="#m-153e674e-2b6c-462e-8156-24b6f1aef85c" label="lyrics-like">I mine, beáti Antónii Abbátis cinio assequámur. Per Dóminum</l><l xml:id="m-daa056c3-7443-4441-98e7-fca61c20b8a7" facs="#m-2e2b2dab-216e-4a22-be21-0dd296338d03" label="lyrics-like">comméndet: t ut quod nostris! nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-485ed13f-003f-4abc-bea0-fc3240b06b16" facs="#m-0de234e0-b70c-4377-93fb-cd6221d1f416" label="text-like">St. Peter’s Chair at Rome.</l><l xml:id="m-24b2e895-359b-4215-b36b-ee074985b836" facs="#m-48dbf9e2-d1a2-428d-8d11-6c984f085a54" label="ambiguous">18.</l><l xml:id="m-f6627d99-b55e-4594-b8b9-a0caf729a537" facs="#m-816bd91c-c4e5-477b-b98c-7c4afa3fd18b" label="ambiguous">Double major.</l><l xml:id="m-1a8c9973-fcea-4548-a15e-bc4ba820cf26" facs="#m-55cc62c7-652e-4cab-b235-d01d1579c4e9" label="text-like">At First Vespers.</l><l xml:id="m-c3666f2e-5ecc-4d03-877e-6d079dbb3b68" facs="#m-d51b67a3-5ec6-471e-b1e0-07e7796b0d16" label="text-like">Ail from the Common of a Confessor Bishop, p. 1173, excent the followins:</l><l xml:id="m-adac0f28-e838-4cf3-b87d-d211e79306c3" facs="#m-111c80f1-7d9b-45e6-9570-b202f0ddf551" label="lyrics-like">Hymn. Quodcúmque in órbe. of second Vespers, p. 1334.</l><l xml:id="m-3d4a6e49-1440-4caa-a7d3-53998762f846" facs="#m-53325d58-6c37-47cd-8c92-dc72ddb78683" label="lyrics-like">V. Tu es Pétrus.</l><l xml:id="m-06cd9905-5534-40df-8465-d566a6d40cf9" facs="#m-a0b49a7a-efb8-4bce-992f-61ad34d08f03" label="lyrics-like">R. Et super hanc pétram aedificábo Ecclésiam méam.</l><l xml:id="m-911df2bd-ce6f-484e-be99-8c841e133d03" facs="#m-4e8ee043-9fb5-4c19-9c1b-9de508c42e95" label="text-like">At Magn.</l><l xml:id="m-dc36e737-87b7-47c9-b2df-fad8ff51669a" facs="#m-92b2d580-7406-4a6c-b7a6-b6dd9e4e6d51" label="ambiguous">Ant. 1.1</l><l xml:id="m-a6069001-41fe-4bbd-9dc2-bde0138aa53e" facs="#m-b1a1b566-7460-461d-80b3-32c93c1a79df" label="lyrics-like">U es pástor óvi-um, “ Prínceps Aposto-ló-rum:</l><l xml:id="m-4eb0b12b-3bd5-4c74-a026-40fcb1ca6749" facs="#m-04799c21-fa88-4a71-8be8-9797d7cbc283" label="lyrics-like">tí-bi trádi-tae sunt clá-ves régni cae-ló-rum. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-e9d5fefe-3299-493f-97cc-7c8676c6c2eb" facs="#m-c257a25a-d3e9-4f4e-9136-40860030da37" label="lyrics-like">Cant. Magníficat. I. f. p. 207.</l><l xml:id="m-f62edc0e-b45a-4c40-9a92-33dc7d90bead" facs="#m-3b4efa01-33ae-4fc3-8239-b8996e67a995" label="lyrics-like">Prayer. Deus qui beáto Petro. D. 1331.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>